TO: His Excellency, The President of the Republic of Zambia
FROM: Major Dr. Kabanga Allan

RE: Briefing – The National Languages (Official Status) Bill, 2025

This memorandum summarizes the rationale, national census support, and cultural-political relevance of the bill to induct Bemba and Lozi as official languages. Your support is sought for Cabinet priority recognition.

Respectfully,

Major Dr. Kabanga Allan
